// Local build settings — machine-specific, not part of the project definition.
//
// Put your Apple Developer Team ID here to run Wand on a real iPhone. Find it in
// Xcode › Settings › Accounts › (your Apple ID) › Manage Certificates, or at
// developer.apple.com/account under Membership. A free Apple ID works; its Team ID is
// the 10-character string shown next to your name.
//
// This lives outside project.yml on purpose: `xcodegen generate` rewrites the Xcode
// project from project.yml, so a team set through Xcode's Signing UI is wiped the next
// time the project is regenerated. Set it here and it survives.

// DEVELOPMENT_TEAM = ABCDE12345
